  <item>
    <title>Vol.05 两年前裸辞做户外博主的人，现在怎么样了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668d185aae8e21859aa1e4b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668d185aae8e21859aa1e4b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr_QyJvzvw8-Z1qi0ytZGPDV5L3s.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>暑假快到了，但打工人还在继续工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请到了，在没有天花板的地方工作的户外博主@金鱼派力西，来跟大家讲讲她是怎么喜欢上户外，又是如何Gap了两年误打误撞成为户外博主的那些事儿。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期节目时间戳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 成为博主的第一个阻碍，居然是丢失素材......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 其实户外还可以治愈失恋！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 累人的爬山，乐趣到底在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 户外博主曾经踩过的雷！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> 精力旺盛是当博主的必要条件吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 做户外博主会影响户外体验吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 五万粉丝的自媒体博主，能实现财务自由了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 裸辞做自媒体博主现在还行得通吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 自媒体博主要怎么缓解数据焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2341">39:01</a> 广告出身的户外博主是怎么接广的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a> 户外博主给户外新手的一些小建议！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a> 所以，把爱好当职业的户外博主，真的能边边玩边赚钱吗？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqte_eg6QE5T3IPB8sQ4teYZaFPm.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Summer Somewhere In Cuba - Cumbia Deli</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsrV1J5f5viM0PRDxEfi4AOgzmpR.m4a" length="46297398" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtHj9koduC9WQMQOMMqYVt8gFFGu.png"/>
