  <item>
    <title>Vol.04「雨天助眠特辑」听着户外的雨声，好好睡一觉吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672847cb6a8412729d6115a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672847cb6a8412729d6115a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbwWqxG23ax0LzAAaB8X6IC_1cW.jpg"></figure><p><span>窗外传来一阵密集的鼓点声</span><br><span>——又下雨了</span></p><p><br><span>都说下雨天是最适合睡觉的天气，我们趁着南方漫长的雨季，回户外的公园录制了一期白噪音。</span></p><p><br><span>在这一期，你将会听到雨声、蝉叫、鸟鸣，还有偶尔从远处传来的清扫声和汽车经过潮湿路面的行驶声。</span></p><p><br><span>希望你能伴随这些户外的声音，好好放松地睡上一觉。</span></p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>本期节目时间戳</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 雨天公园的白噪音：雨滴声、蝉叫、鸟鸣......</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk6BFxQNEx9SJRQnbwfx2T2qa4o9.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong><br><span>Quiet Nights - Nate Blaze</span></p></li></ul>]]></description>
