  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 真香警告！户外做的白米饭，吃起来会更香吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666aae3ec26e396a3681673b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666aae3ec26e396a3681673b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFMFsQ7pmo8tED2gn-Wsa8TbYh5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>出门去哪都好，总不能饿着肚子吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以本期，两位主播叽森和痴少邀请到我们户外社群的白饭专家 ACE，来跟大家仔细讲解一下：如何在户外不饿着自己，做好一顿饭？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>· 本期节目时间戳</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 原来还能把煮坏的白米饭重新煮活了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a></span><strong><span>「本期精华」</span></strong><span>白饭专家的不翻车煮饭攻略！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 泰式罗勒叶炒猪肉饭（打抛饭）居然也能在户外完成？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 先保证自己在户外不会饿到肚子的简单快手菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 在户外有一口汤喝，能提升你的幸福感！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 在户外烤棉花糖还有新思路？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 夏天户外的幸福感，其实来自于保温壶？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> 在户外做完饭之后，怎么收拾？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> 从银河和星空那里，获取一点生活的能量！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llK9LWMuBZ7RTAOm9_K6TbSgHLRY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgoK-j1IwwW9BFG-89Ip4K7ZS1J.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgcTTu3kZN8DR75h1bA1rR4JYW1i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>希望大家能从今天的嘉宾的分享中</span></p><span></span><p><span>获得一些日常做饭的实用小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区留下你回户外爱吃的菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>也推荐大家一边收听本期播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>一边尝试一次「户外做饭」这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论在哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>都要记得好好吃饭哦～</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loBk29EcG_O1HqHr1zm4XZUqugT4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>· 本期音乐Summer Somewhere In Cuba - Cumbia Deli</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljqUJQhO5ezkqZo2EdTFBDjkJkAg.m4a" length="50493292" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmS2FrphRl7bY4ds5mnTbBl2IYW8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 真羡慕你！你爸妈不仅帮你请假，还跟你一起玩户外！｜儿童节特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659fe9294977a26ef589073</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659fe9294977a26ef589073</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lugIVyQgc56XenLVF-rQVDRzK_rE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最终，户外的风还是吹进了婴儿车里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>六一儿童节前夕，主播叽森顺利抓到马上又要回户外玩的两位资深户外爱好者：Rachel和C哥，来跟大家一起聊聊户外带娃的那些事儿。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期节目时间戳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 真的会有爸妈帮小孩跟学校请假，然后一起出去玩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 资深户外爸妈会带着 8 个月大，都还没学会走路的婴儿去长白山滑雪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 爱干净的处女座小朋友回到户外会变成怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 资深户外爸妈都是怎么引诱害怕虫子的小朋友出门的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 户外对小朋友的好处是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 你有多久没摸过小草啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 资深户外爸妈给大家推荐一些户外新手带小朋友出门的玩法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 资深户外爸妈分享带小朋友回户外必要的安全知识和装备！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 资深户外爸妈会想让自己的小朋友做个更资深的户外人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 资深户外爸妈自己是怎么开启户外之旅的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2719">45:19</a> 做有趣的家长会不会很耗时间，很费金钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> 给还在过儿童节的大朋友、小朋友们，送来一些关于成长、关于生活的一些祝福！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqolhwUxNPN-zg7ephNbNobF3riX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>希望大家能从今天的两位嘉宾的分享中</span></p><span></span><p><span>得到一些如何好好照顾自己、好好生活的启发💡</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区留下你和小朋友一起出门的玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家订阅我们的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们一起回户外！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Summer Somewhere In Cuba - Cumbia Deli</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj0vOkUtx7CBeizlNgl45F0L3iQX.m4a" length="40304271" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaP-vss2GFZkaKMBxGLTZ-OBH-G.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 不想出门？那我们先给你 20 个理由够不够！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66445a10251bd96e6c749d17</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66445a10251bd96e6c749d17</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 06:45:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltMlJfrjxe47b-r3mG432LHkj7iK.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>嗨，朋友们！第一次见面，欢迎来到「蕉下Anti」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们希望在这里跟大家分享更多日常、生动、可行的出门方式，在接下来的节目中和大家一起探索至少</span><strong><span>100种</span></strong><span>轻松出门的灵感！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是我们的第一期节目，两位主播叽森和痴少，作为曾经都很不爱出门的普通人，到现在慢慢接受出门、喜欢上户外，在第一期将跟大家讲讲各自以及周围朋友轻松走出门的理由。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>先给你20个出门理由够不够？</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我们有人是因为找</span><strong><span>好喝的冻柠茶</span></strong><span>而走出家门</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人是因为想要</span><strong><span>解冻身体</span></strong><span>而出走写字楼</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有朋友是因为走出门去而</span><strong><span>找到了对象</span></strong><span>......</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>为什么要出门？出门有什么好处？</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我们期待能在这期节目里</span></p><span></span><p><span>用我们轻松、好玩的出门日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>具体回答你有关出门的这些问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>帮大家推开那扇看似有点沉重的门</span></p><span></span><p><span>让你能从门缝里窥探到一点关于生活的新灵感</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期节目时间戳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 从恐惧户外到爱上户外，中间到底发生了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 我们为什么要出门，出门有什么好处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 广东人会为了喝冻柠茶而迈出门？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 把在室内做的事情，搬到户外会发生什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 出门晒个太阳，晚上就能睡好觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 和小猫一起晒太阳，结果被公园所有人围观？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 爱情其实都是从户外开始的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 用露营车摆摊竟然改变了TA的职业赛道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> 在散步的时候观察人类，像是去现实生活中参观电影～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">46:58</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> 大家下一次出门的理由会是......？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgOg8_CYflDCOz-l3M83G6C4RUF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区跟我们一起分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>你上一次新鲜又有趣的出门理由和冲动</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家订阅我们节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起回户外，听大自然的声音！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1. Summer Somewhere In Cuba - Cumbia Deli</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Louis Vuitton SoundWalk: Hong Kong</span><br><span>路易威登 声音漫步：香港_舒淇（国语版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. Louis Vuitton SoundWalk: Hong Kong</span></p><span></span><p><span>路易威登 声音漫步：香港_舒淇（粤语版）</span></p>]]></description>
